H7501.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 26:7; 
son of: Shemaiah (H8098I); 
brother of: Othni (H6273), Obed (H5744J), Elzabad (H0443H), Elihu (H0453I) and Semachiah (H5565) 
§ Rephael = "healed of God"
son of Shemaiah and grandson of Obed-edom

H7506.def:
A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:25; 
son of: Beriah (H1283H); 
brother of: Sheerah (H7609) and Resheph (H7566) 
§ Rephah = "healing of the breath"
son of Ephraim and a ancestor of Joshua

H7509K.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:37; 
son of: Binea (H1150); 
brother of: Eleasah (H0501H) and Azel (H0682A); also called Rephaiah at 1 Chroniques 9:43; 
Another name of ra.pah (רָפָא "Raphah" H7498G)
§ Rephaiah = "healed of Jehovah"
1) a descendant of Zerubbabel and David
2) a Simeonite chief in the reign of Hezekiah
3) son of Tola and grandson of Issachar
4) son of Binea and a descendant of Saul
5) son of Hur and a ruler of Jerusalem in the time of Nehemiah

H7525.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:39; 
son of: Shual (H7777B); 
brother of: Arah (H0733) and Hanniel (H2592H) 
§ Rezia = "delight"
an Asherite of the sons of Ulla

H7532.def:
A woman living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 3:7; 
daughter of: Aiah (H0345H); married to Saul (H7586G); 
mother of: Armoni (H0764) and Mephibosheth (H4648H) 
§ Rizpah = "pavement"
a concubine of king Saul and mother of Armoni and Mephibosheth

H7552I.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:43; 
son of: Hebron (H2275I); 
brother of: Korah (H7141J), Tappuah (H8599A) and Shema (H8087); 
father of: Shammai (H8060H)
§ Rekem = "variegation"
one of the 4 sons of Hebron and the father of Shammai

H7552J.def:
A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:16; 
son of: Sheresh (H8329); 
brother of: Ulam (H0198)
§ Rekem = "variegation"
a Manassite, son of Machir by Maachah his wife

H7566.def:
A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:25; 
son of: Beriah (H1283H); 
brother of: Sheerah (H7609) and Rephah (H7506); 
father of: Telah (H8520) 
§ Resheph = "flame"
a son of Ephraim

H7586H.def:
A man of the tribe of Simeon living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:10; 
son of: Simeon (H8095) and Canaanite_woman (H3669); 
brother of: Jemuel (H3223), Jamin (H3226), Ohad (H0161), Jachin (H3199) and Zerah (H2226L); 
father of: Shallum (H7967K)
Also named: sha.u.li (שָׁאוּלִי "Shaulite" H7587)
§ Saul or Shaul = "desired"
1) a Benjamite, son of Kish, and the 1st king of Israel
2) an early king of Edom and a successor of Samlah
3) a son of Simeon
4) a Levite, son of Uzziah

H7586J.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:24; 
son of: Uzziah (H5818H); 
father of: Elkanah (H0511I); also called Joel at 1 Chroniques 6:36; 
Also named: yo.el (יוֹאֵל "Joel" H3100U)
§ Saul or Shaul = "desired"
1) a Benjamite, son of Kish, and the 1st king of Israel
2) an early king of Edom and a successor of Samlah
3) a son of Simeon
4) a Levite, son of Uzziah

H7587.def:
Someone descended from Shaul who was a man of the tribe of Simeon living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:10; 
son of: Simeon (H8095) and Canaanite_woman (H3669); 
brother of: Jemuel (H3223), Jamin (H3226), Ohad (H0161), Jachin (H3199) and Zerah (H2226L); 
father of: Shallum (H7967K)
Group of sha.ul (שָׁאוּל "Shaul" H7586H) 
§ Shaulites, of Saul "desired"
descendants of Saul or Shaul

H7597A.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:17; 
son of: Jehoiachin (H3078); 
brother of: Zedekiah (H6667I)(?); father(?) of Malchiram (H4443), Pedaiah (H6305H), Shenazzar (H8137), Jekamiah (H3359H), Hoshama (H1953) and Nedabiah (H5072)
§ Shealtiel or Salathiel = "I have asked of God"
son of king Jehoiachin or Jeconiah or Coniah of Judah and uncle of Zerubbabel

H7597B.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:17; 
son of: Jehoiachin (H3078); 
brother of: Zedekiah (H6667I)(?); father(?) of Malchiram (H4443), Pedaiah (H6305H), Shenazzar (H8137), Jekamiah (H3359H), Hoshama (H1953) and Nedabiah (H5072)
Another spelling of she.al.ti.el (שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל "Shealtiel" H7597A)
§ Shealtiel or Salathiel = "I have asked of God"
father of Zerubbabel

H7598.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:17; 
son of: Jehoiachin (H3078); 
brother of: Zedekiah (H6667I)(?); father(?) of Malchiram (H4443), Pedaiah (H6305H), Shenazzar (H8137), Jekamiah (H3359H), Hoshama (H1953) and Nedabiah (H5072)
Aramaic of she.al.ti.el (שְׁאַלְתִּיאֵל "Shealtiel" H7597A) 
§ Shealtiel = "I have asked of God"
father of Zerubbabel
